# 小屏, a finger: a chat opened from the chats and gone back from, six times: what opening a chat costs, its first
# frames above all (a page built anew, its rows too). Some 300 ms of work in all.
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 500
log measure
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
tap 整理发布清单
wait 600
back
wait 600
exit
